<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Oct 31 foreign reserves at $8.23 bln.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Oct 31 foreign reserves at $8.23 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's net foreign reserves stood at $8.23 billion as of October 31, the most recent date for which official figures are available, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said the figure marked the highest since January 20, when Colombia's net reserves totalled $8.28 billion.</p>
<p>Net reserves have decreased by $85.2 million, or 1.0 percent, since December 30 of last year.</p>
<p>-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944</p>
